{"about_the_game":"The Kingdom of Oukoku is threatened by the spicy influence of General Tso. Citizens have placed their hope in a small knight who fits the requirements of ancient legends. Which path will the Chibi Knight choose... the path to the mysterious Island of Mahou to learn spells from its sorcerers or the path to the Beastmaster mountains to summon and ride an array of ferocious animals? Your choice will determine Oukoku's fate!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSuper Chibi Knight is an action adventure platformer with RPG elements. It was made by 33 year-old Dad and 8-year-old Daughter team PestoForce. The cute and colorful art and animation brings to life a rich world with a deep history and many secrets. Your in-game choices will determine your specialty, Sorcerer or Beastmaster, each affecting the course of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to reach the dastardly General Tso and stop him from taking over the world?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spice is Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/2e2d005363d926775e3270d1f2e999d2ff73d379.jpg"},{"name":"Stings and Stones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/79a7ced97fdadf571a93f0f4b908c97393e601bd.jpg"},{"name":"Scrollin' on da River","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/cb3e38730b03bb97560cdc4ac7622f0385d0bb77.jpg"},{"name":"Jelly Much?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/1878f929f096aa3d3ecd796b345101eee3fb23e3.jpg"},{"name":"Roy Orb-ison","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/4938633c1d9c327fe65fd776f2c6ac90d053a3d2.jpg"},{"name":"Muncher Plague Eliminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/283080/7782da644061dff67f776bdcd9e2c17988b24123.jpg"},{"name":"Ork-estrated Attacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta